      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1899-12-15_WidnesExaminer_art0053" n="art0053">
        <head>IMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENT OF</head>
        <p>IMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENT OF</p>
        <p>PITTS'S LONDON—ROAD, MANCHESTER IJust Past Station, through Railway Arch), THE RENOWNED GENERAL FURNISHERS.</p>
        <p>PITTS'S BEG TO ANNOUNCE that from November 1, 1899, PITTS'S will allnw all pgym.nts from PITTS'S numerous customers, who have been called up for ACTIVE SERVICE, to ren.ain in abeyance until three months after the conclusion of peace ; also if unfortunately any of such customers should be killed whilst in active service, PITTS'S will CANCEL ALL FURTHER PAYMENTS, and con- vey the wiods absolutely without any further charge to the next ot kin. PI LTS'S hone that this announcement will stimulate other Furnishing and Piano Firms to emulate PITTS'S example in this respect. and so render assistance where it will certainly be keenly appreciated.</p>
        <p>DITTS'S.-HOUmES OF FURNITURE at 14, 22f, 28i, 38i, 50, 75, 100, 200, up to 1,000 guineas, has been pronounced by pr .ctical people the PINNACLE OF PER- FECTION. Indeed, they are tha TOP OF ADaiIRATION. Their high Artistic and Intrinsic Merits, their Beauty and VALUE, are apparent to casual inspectiQn, which closer examination and wear only confirm. Full particulars. Press opinions, testimonials, and NEW ILLUSTRATED FURNISHING GUIDE, containing 700 designs,and showing at a glance HOW TO SAW.; 50 per cent., sent post free. Cash prices only quoted. Deferrad payments arranged.</p>
        <p>DITTS'S DIN ING-ROO NI SUITS (Second- hand).—Magnifieeut solid Walnut Suite, in rich Oriental Saddlebags, with velvet borders, divan couch, and elegant easy and small chairs, cost £3), for £l3 ; massive spoon back Suite, very fine, heave frames, in real skins, cost £35. for £l5 ; grand solid Oak Suite, frames exceptionally heavy, and elaborately carved, very uncommon design, cost £4O, tor £l7 ; another similar. in Walnut, £lB. Choice of 200 from £6 to £6O; marvellous value. Dining Tables all sizes.</p>
        <p>pITTS'S SIDEtSOAIIDS (Second-hand).—Handy Sidebpard. in Walnut, latest design, fitted with drawers, cupboards, etc., cost £7, for £3 5s ; substantial olid Oak Sideboard, massive and bold. cost £lO, for £5 ; Very Special Solid Oak Sideboard, splendid design and work- manship, cost £l2, for £7 ; mat-venous ,3ideboard, very im- posing design, cost £2O, for £9; grand walnut Sideboard, cost £24. for £l2. Infinite variety, up to £6O eAch. It will pay you well to give us a call.</p>
        <p>DITTS'S DRAWING-ROOM SUITES (Second- hand).—Artistic Chippekdale Suite, Oriental covering, cost £l2 for £6 108 ; Inlaid Mahogany Suite, covered in silk, cost £lB for £9; Ohippo-Aale Suite, expensive choice silk covering, cost £2O, for £(0 13s ; exquisite Inlaid Rose wood Suite of choice character, 1 ttest design, beautifully covered in silk Tapestry, cost £25, for £l4 ; elegant Louis XV. Suite, in Dark Chippendale Mahogany, beautifully covered, cost £35. for £l9. Hundred) to select from. uo to 2:40 each. In- spection invited. Cabinets and Overmantles of every design.</p>
        <p>IIDITTS'S BEDROOM. FURNITIME,(second-hand). —Elegant Bedroom Suite, landampe pattern, carved panels and bevelled plates, cost £l3, for £10: tasteful Suite in Walnut, finely designed wardrobe. with bevelled mirrors, everything complete. large-sized etands and tables, pedestal, rail; chairs, cost £3O, for £l5 : Magnificent Suite of full number of articles, all large,of best workmanship cud design. cost RIO, for £18; anoth,r similar, cost £5O, for £24. A hundred others up to £9O each. Must be promptly eleared out, irrespective of profit.</p>
        <p>BEDSITADS', CARP&amp;PS, CYCLES Bassinettes, Mail Carts, Lamps, C%!na, Glass, Hannan ware.' AUgnificent selection.', Guaranteed great saving.</p>
        <p>pITTS'S OFFICE AND LIBRARY FURNITURE. --Rvery description of HookeAses. Secretaires, Desks, Stools, Chairs, Safes. Copying Presses at about Hatt City Prices.</p>
        <p>5A.1.11.7EL, PITTS. Establisned 1845 K./ LONDON-ROAD (just plat Station) MANCHESTER, Atdwiek, Longeight, snd Belle Vue Cars pass tie Door.</p>
