      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1899-12-15_WidnesExaminer_art0054" n="art0054">
        <head>FATHER CHRISTMAS COME 3 AGAIN</head>
        <p>FATHER CHRISTMAS COME 3 AGAIN</p>
        <p>TO PRESIDE OVER TUE FESTITITIES ATTENDING</p>
        <p>THE OPENING CEREAONY OF THE LIVERPOOL COMPTON HOUSE</p>
        <p>GREAT CHRISTAIAS FANCY FAIR,</p>
        <p>BAZAAR, AND YULE-TIDE AIARKET,</p>
