      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1899-12-15_WidnesExaminer_art0055" n="art0055">
        <head>DAILY RECEPTIONS</head>
        <p>DAILY RECEPTIONS</p>
        <p>BY FATHER CHRISTMAS</p>
        <p>IN THE ENCHANTED GROTTO,</p>
        <p>Where Beautiful Fairies, Expressly Imported for the</p>
        <p>Season, will Present Each Visitor with the (. I.IIARV EL" GROTTO PARCEL,</p>
        <p>which (when the Healthful Enjoyment it will provide</p>
        <p>for its possessor is taken into consideration)</p>
        <p>will be found WORTH ITS WEIGHT IN</p>
        <p>SOLID broLD.</p>
        <p>FATHER CHRISTNiIAS, in inviting his Friends to pay him a visit at the Compton House Toy and Fancy Fair,offers to each and allsacorlial shake of the hand and a hearty welcome. Although. to his deep regret, he has not succeeded in bringing with him that Peace co. Earth so multi to be desired, yet, he looks with cheerful confidence to that near future when those Grim Monsters War, Ignorance, Superstition, and Cruelty will be vanquished in the light of his good-will to men in every land ; and he trusts that, be- fore his final visit of the 19th Century, Important steps will have been taken towards developing the vast resources of a hitherto Dark Continent to the benefit of its entire popula- tion, to the extension of British Commerce and the advantage of the world at large.</p>
        <p>THIS WAY! THIS WAY! THIS WAY!</p>
        <p>FOR 'TIE To AND NOVELTY FAIR,</p>
        <p>THIS WAY FOR THE DOLLS!</p>
