        <p>spirit and seem&amp; to enjoy her food. Her skin came naturagv white and fair, and all who knew her could see the improvement, for she rapidly put on flesh. Some people will no doubt think these statements overdrawn, mere puff, but the camera cannot lie, and I have pleisure in enclosing photo, which you me at libeity to make public with th's letter, as I feel your remedy should be in the hands of all parents of weakly children and cannot be made tco widely known.—Believe me, yours very truly,</p>
