        <p>GRAND BAZAAR PARR HALL, APRIL 11TH AND 12TH, 19C0.</p>
        <p>TRANSVAAL CAMPAIGN SCHOOL GIRLS' CON- TRIBUTION TO THE MAYOR'S FUND. The Committee have decided to hold a SALE OF WORK, by the kind permission of the Mayor, at the TOWN HALL, on TUESDAY the 16th January neat. Contributions of articles for the Sale will be thankfully received at the Town Hall on behalf of the Committee by ETHEL C. ROBERTS. 1, ETHEL LYON WHITTLE. 1110 n. Secretaries.</p>
